2
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.460
Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,

3
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.840
raising our battle cry.

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.220
If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.630
ring out.

6
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.310
We were able to escape from the set course

7
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.860
along the boundary between sky and sea.

8
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.110
Now we're rowing our way

9
00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:40.620
to a hidden adventure at the dark bottom of the sea.

10
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:47.460
Doesn't it sound fun just thinking about it?

11
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.880
Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,

12
00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.220
raising our battle cry.

13
00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:58.550
If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure

14
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.970
ring out.

15
00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.570
That feeling we had when we set sail

16
00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:15.030
is something I'll never forget.

17
00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.820
Because of that

18
00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:20.490
nothing will be able to scare me...

19
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:26.750
Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats

20
00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:33.670
engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.

21
00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.090
Get all the treasures

22
00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:40.350
while laughing out loud.

23
00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:44.770
Give them all out at a big party

24
00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.440
making a splash...

25
00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.620
Fill your empty heart with dreams.

26
00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.960
Spread your wings.

27
00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:11.290
If you color your heart with the blowing wind

28
00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.630
you will move on.

29
00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:17.800
Get all the treasures

30
00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.130
while laughing out loud.

31
00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:24.490
Give them all out at a big party

32
00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.270
making a splash...

33
00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:35.590
<b>The Fearsome Ability of the Shadow Fruit!
The Ultimate Number 900!</b>

34
00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.180
It's not over!

35
00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:40.070
Despite cutting him, he's still a zombie.

36
00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.430
He'll keep getting up!

37
00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.580
You...!

38
00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:49.080
Wait a sec... I've seen you before...

39
00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.500
Worry not.

40
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.300
I've finished him off already.

41
00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.670
Finished?

42
00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.900
These zombies have a weak point.

43
00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.120
What is that?!

44
00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.040
That's the zombie's soul.

45
00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.160
Soul?

46
00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.710
It's coming out right before our eyes!

47
00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:19.070
Now, return to your master!

48
00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.000
Commander Tararan!

49
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.230
The commander was defeated!

50
00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.480
He completely stopped moving.

51
00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.780
What did you do?!

52
00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.040
Purification.

53
00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:40.920
Look!

54
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.800
There's no doubt, he is the "Humming One".

55
00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.100
He's the man who caused a ruckus in Thriller Bark five years ago.

56
00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.350
Inform master!

57
00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:57.840
This spider's web is indeed strong against physical force, but still weak to fire.

58
00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:03.020
You're right!

59
00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:03.930
It melted!

60
00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.640
Straw Hat and the others were abducted.

61
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.750
It seems you know quite a lot about this island.

62
00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.500
Yes.

63
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.840
However, I'm not quite sure how to put this.

64
00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.900
The fact that they've been captured means there is a strong possibility it may already be too late.

65
00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:20.970
What?!

66
00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.360
Too late?!

67
00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.260
P-Please don't get mad at me.

68
00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.030
Let's keep a straight face!

69
00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.100
Even though as a skeleton, I don't have a face!

70
00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.130
Skull joke!

71
00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.130
Stop it, he's already dead.

72
00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.000
Anyway,

73
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.130
Stop joking and listen to me.

74
00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.680
Stop it, he's already dead.

75
00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:49.880
It is as I told you on the ship, when my ship's rudder failed,

76
00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:53.930
I began wandering the sea alone decades ago...

77
00:04:54.470 --> 00:05:01.610
I thought of escaping this evil sea, but with the rudder broken I was just a puppet of the sea current.

78
00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.230
That was more than five years ago.

79
00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:10.830
And just like you now, I eventually was lead to Thriller Bark.

80
00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:15.460
I wanted to leave the Florian Triangle no matter what.

81
00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:21.190
Hoping that there might be parts to fix the rudder on the island, I investigated.

82
00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:30.050
When I entered, I found nothing but zombies and monsters in the way.

83
00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.020
Before long I was captured and brought to this building.

84
00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:45.440
Inside I saw a combat dancer who was caught earlier and a patched corpse which they called a marionette.

85
00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.430
Afterwards, a terrifying and huge man appeared, and...!

86
00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.490
He tore the man's shadow from the floor!

87
00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.290
He cut it off!

88
00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.910
His shadow was cut off?

89
00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.380
I thought my eyes were deceiving me... even though...

90
00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.230
I don't have any eyes.

91
00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.730
Stop joking or I'll kick your ass!

92
00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.180
I don't mind if you do.

93
00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:19.480
I was to have the same fate before long.

94
00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.610
The one whose shadow was taken collapsed where he stood.

95
00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:27.310
On the other hand, his severed shadow was pressed inside the unmoving body of the marionette.

96
00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.210
I didn't think that was possible...

97
00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.620
How he did it, I'm unsure...

98
00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.060
But, the marionette corpse just...

99
00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.250
Started moving on its own!

100
00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.420
What do you mean?

101
00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:45.800
A shadow is another soul that goes and moves along with you anywhere.

102
00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.760
It follows you from birth to death.

103
00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:55.200
It's a soul that will never leave you, that will always obey and follow you.

104
00:06:55.200 --> 00:07:00.230
The man that seizes these, and has them obey his will is...

105
00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.550
The Royal Warlord of the Sea, Gekko Moriah!

106
00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.650
The user of the Shadow Fruit.

107
00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.360
A devil fruit, huh?

108
00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:15.640
As long as there's a corpse, he can use a shadow to bring forth a zombie.

109
00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:24.540
The problem is that the genius surgeon who creates these tough creatures, Doctor Hogback... has friends.

110
00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:29.190
In some cases, he gets parts from different graveyards...

111
00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:32.260
Using the corpses of legendary warriors to revive them.

112
00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:39.180
Moreover, he has an immense amount of enumerated marionettes still stored in a freezer in his lab.

113
00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.790
Dr. Hogback...

114
00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:48.800
So that famous doctor came to this place after the incident of his disappearance to help a pirate.

115
00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:55.490
Then, the zombies' bodies can move, so it's not like they've been resurrected.

116
00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.130
Correct.

117
00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:02.640
The shadow holds both the personality and fighting skills of its owner.

118
00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:06.900
The physical strength of the marionette is limited by the power of it's body.

119
00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:12.270
When both strong shadow and body are merged, the result is an even more powerful zombie.

120
00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:18.590
That is why Moriah so eagerly desires the shadows of bounty heads.

121
00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:19.930
I see.

122
00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:22.430
They were after us from the start.

123
00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.690
So that's the whole story of Thriller Bark.

124
00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:29.820
To Moriah, the zombie's most important characteristic might be obedience.

125
00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.570
The stronger the warrior the harder it must be to make it listen.

126
00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:37.530
True... they receive the same fighting spirit and skill as their owner.

127
00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:42.250
The strong ones are set adrift at sea after they lose consciousness.

128
00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.210
Then, they...!

129
00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.170
This is bad.

130
00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.470
They're safe yet.

131
00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.680
We have time.

132
00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:51.960
Right now I will tell you the best plan we have.

133
00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.110
So please, trust me and do as I say.

134
00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.760
Trust you?!

135
00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:02.470
Skull Shock!

136
00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:08.560
I haven't had a conversation like this in decades! It's so fun!

137
00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.980
We're listening, so tell us quickly.

138
00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:11.920
Okay...

139
00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.300
Master!

140
00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.610
The Three Mysterious Persons have arrived!

141
00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.580
That was quick. Enter.

142
00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.830
Please, come inside.

143
00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.920
You finally came.

144
00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:37.430
Make me the Pirate King.

145
00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.020
Very soon.

146
00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.120
You're no Pirate King!

147
00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.600
The Pirate King will be...

148
00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.640
Me!

149
00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:50.770
Hey! Untie this string you giant leek!

150
00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:54.680
Usopp, Nami, Chopper, Sanji, Zoro... Give them all back!

151
00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:57.010
Where did you take them, leek?!

152
00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.660
What a splendidly strong man.

153
00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.890
So this is Straw Hat Luffy.

154
00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.330
Hey, Straw Hat Luffy.

155
00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.290
You mentioned many names.

156
00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.210
We've only captured three of you so far.

157
00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:16.210
The Pirate Hunter Zoro and a blond guy with no wanted poster.

158
00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.760
Could that blond guy be Sanji...?

159
00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.300
What?!

160
00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:26.080
Hey, it seems Zoro and Sanji also got caught.

161
00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.330
No way, and Luffy was also caught!

162
00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:34.120
H-How come that monstrous trio got caught so easily?!

163
00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:40.030
I don't know who these guys are, but they're definitely bad news!

164
00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:45.240
By the way, what happened with those three, Perona?

165
00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.290
The Risky Brothers were supposed to deliver them...

166
00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.310
They didn't bring them to Kumashi.

167
00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.920
Didn't they escape while they were being delivered?

168
00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.740
They're talking about us.

169
00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.510
Don't say it. You... Don't say it!

170
00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.950
I told you not to open your mouth!

171
00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.370
You're too strict with Kumashi...

172
00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.560
Way too strict.

173
00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:11.630
Anyways, I was trying to get a hold of my bride when those three...

174
00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:15.110
Ran into your garden and caused a disturbance.

175
00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:17.690
Hey, wait a second.

176
00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.200
That means... Hogback...!

177
00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.510
Bastard, do you mean that one of you laid a hand on my bride?!

178
00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.280
So that's what happened before!

179
00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.760
Your bride is not coming.

180
00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.840
What was that, Cindry!?

181
00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.280
Hey! Hey! Cindry-chan, you're making it worse!

182
00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:39.380
And why did you step out in front of me?

183
00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.450
Yours won't be coming either.

184
00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:44.850
What a low blow! Where did that come from?!

185
00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.810
Stop! Stop!

186
00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.930
Stop this pointless discussion.

187
00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:52.730
If some pirates got away, then you guys can do something about it later.

188
00:11:53.770 --> 00:12:01.070
I gathered you here to celebrate the creation of a great fighting asset.

189
00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.170
Who is that guy!?

190
00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:11.390
Master, that pirate bit the cage apart to escape!

191
00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:12.850
He...!

192
00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.510
Bit the cage!

193
00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.840
What're you gonna do to catch me now?!

194
00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.180
What a promising man!

195
00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.220
Wait, Absalom, we're inside a room.

196
00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.500
I'll stop him.

197
00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.580
Like you'd catch me, idiot!

198
00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.710
Negative Hollow!

199
00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:47.570
If I were to be reborn, I want to become a sea slug...

200
00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:52.430
The man who just said he wanted to be Pirate King now wants to be a sea slug...

201
00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.580
Atrocious...

202
00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.790
Turn the light on!

203
00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.530
What're you doing, damn it!

204
00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:00.730
You'll regret this!

205
00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.220
W-What's that?!

206
00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.550
My shadow...!

207
00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.770
I finally have it!

208
00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.830
The 300 million fighting power!

209
00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:34.600
With this, the Ultimate Special Zombie can be created!

210
00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.590
Go back to the ship?

211
00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.870
To the Sunny?

212
00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.470
Correct.

213
00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:53.490
The worst case scenario is that your friends have been captured and their shadows have been stolen.

214
00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:57.640
However, having their shadow stolen isn't going to kill them.

215
00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:00.630
Take a look at what happened to me!

216
00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.460
Ah, I died!

217
00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.050
That's a different story!

218
00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.070
Anyway...

219
00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:10.260
In short, even if they got their shadow stolen, they won't die.

220
00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.710
That's right.

221
00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.560
However, the moment their shadows are taken, they become vulnerable as they lose consciousness.

222
00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.580
And won't wake up for two days.

223
00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:23.460
During this time they put those who are strong into boats and cast them off from Thriller Bark.

224
00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:27.050
I've said this before but, do you know why they do that?

225
00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:31.610
So that the victims won't attempt to return to the island and reclaim their shadows, right?

226
00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:32.710
Precisely.

227
00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:35.710
Then, why not just kill them while they're unconscious?

228
00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.660
They cannot.

229
00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:41.210
This is very important, so listen carefully.

230
00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.550
First of all...

231
00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:48.480
Although the body and the shadow may be separated, they're part of one being.

232
00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.680
If the body dies, then the shadow is doomed as well.

233
00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:56.010
In other words, the moment that happens, the zombie will also perish.

234
00:14:56.010 --> 00:15:00.480
This means trouble for the enemy, so they make sure to keep the body alive.

235
00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:05.710
Which means that, even if your friends have been stripped off their shadows...

236
00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.640
They are surely alive and are being taken back to the ship.

237
00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.300
That's why...!

238
00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:18.770
If you two become victims as well, this will turn into the worst case scenario!

239
00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:23.650
Everyone would've lost their shadows and will be left to wander the sea.

240
00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:28.920
But something can still be done. If we wake up your friends...

241
00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.420
We'll have one chance to figure out how to recover the stolen shadows.

242
00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:37.370
Did you get all that?

243
00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.180
I see.

244
00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:42.840
That makes sense.

245
00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.130
Take this, you two.

246
00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.160
What is it?

247
00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.550
The zombies' weakness.

248
00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:53.010
It's effectiveness against the Spider Monkey is proof!

249
00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.380
Weakness?

250
00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:55.820
What is this?

251
00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.810
Salt.

252
00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.580
Salt?

253
00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:04.920
So it's kinda like we're defeating some evil being by purifying it?

254
00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.450
Well, you could say that.

255
00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:11.510
The zombies are originally animated by the power of the devil fruit.

256
00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:14.940
Just as the sea nullifies the abilities of a devil fruit user...

257
00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:21.870
the salt which has the sea's power undoes the bond between the false soul and the corpse.

258
00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.510
I see.

259
00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:29.940
So that thing that flew out of the monkey's mouth a little while ago was the shadow from within his body.

260
00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.110
To think they had such a weakness...

261
00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:37.000
Now then, to defeat the Zombies, simply throw the salt into their mouths!

262
00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.310
That's the trick!

263
00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.770
The only trick!

264
00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:40.860
The trick!

265
00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:42.740
The trick, the trick, the trick!

266
00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:42.250
But Brook...

267
00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:47.120
Why is it that you happen to know so much about this island and the zombies?

268
00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.320
When my shadow was stolen five years ago...

269
00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:57.950
Naturally, I was cast off in my ship, but luckily enough I woke up in time to find a way back.

270
00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:02.640
And then I returned to the island...

271
00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.910
To fight...

272
00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:10.920
The zombie that has my shadow!

273
00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:17.110
But... I was completely defeated.

274
00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:23.370
I shamefully ran to save my life...

275
00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.370
No matter what...

276
00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.500
No matter what... I didn't want to die.

277
00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:33.440
Because I was the sole survivor from my ship.

278
00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:41.410
Because I promised my friends that one day I'd escape from this Devil Sea...

279
00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.870
I shamefully ran to save my life!

280
00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:51.960
And though I managed to live a long while, I was unable to achieve any resolution.

281
00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.470
That's why... I will not escape this time!

282
00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.050
Until I beat that man and recover my shadow I-

283
00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.030
Well then...

284
00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:09.320
Please excuse me, I'll go ahead.

285
00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.050
Have a good day.

286
00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.770
Wait a minute!

287
00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:19.030
While we're still at it, just answer me one more question.

288
00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.130
L-Luffy!

289
00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:32.360
What was that... just now?

290
00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.290
His shadow...!

291
00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.940
His shadow was ripped off!

292
00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:41.260
It's just like the story that skeleton Brook told us.

293
00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:46.020
If his shadow was taken... then that means this guy also took Brook's!

294
00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.490
I can't believe it...

295
00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.120
How come he can do such a thing?

296
00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:54.830
Kumashi! You were blabbering again weren't you?!

297
00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.670
You're too strict with Kumashi...

298
00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.860
Way too strict.

299
00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:07.080
This guy will bring me one step closer to being the Pirate King, right Hogback?

300
00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:16.270
Since the day I met you ten years ago, I've served you for the day Number 900 would be made.

301
00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.940
With that shadow we can create the greatest zombie ever made...

302
00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:23.450
And without a doubt, it'll become a huge source of power for us!

303
00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:29.850
The day that I will be known worldwide as the Graveyard King has come closer!

304
00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:38.400
My dream kingdom where all the world's cute things will become zombies and serve me is before my eyes!

305
00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:44.100
Even the most insolent bastard will become an obedient zombie if I take his shadow!

306
00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:48.410
I'll turn this world into one full of obedient zombies!

307
00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.640
If I had a servant like this back then...

308
00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:56.040
I wouldn't have lost to that idiot Kaidou in the New World!

309
00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:59.210
Let's wake him up already!

310
00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:00.230
Gyoro!

311
00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:00.860
Nin!

312
00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:01.570
Bao!

313
00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.320
Yes, master!

314
00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:06.380
Open the door to the special freezer!

315
00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.240
Right away, master!

316
00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:14.350
Just you wait, 900.

317
00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.280
Spider Mouse.

318
00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:21.720
Dump Straw Hat Luffy's body on his ship.

319
00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:25.410
And don't forget to remove the thread, it'll be troublesome if he dies.

320
00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:26.530
Yes!

321
00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:28.370
Please wait! I have a report!

322
00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.860
What is it?

323
00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:34.830
Just now, Commander Spider Monkey Tararan was defeated!

324
00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.430
Defeated?

325
00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:40.260
That's not possible, unless his shadow is extracted.

326
00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.330
His shadow was extracted!

327
00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:47.200
Absalom...

328
00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:50.610
The only man capable of such a thing, is him!

329
00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.520
The Chivalrous Humming Swordsman!

330
00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.970
It seems the report Hildon gave me wasn't wrong.

331
00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:58.020
This is terrible!

332
00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.900
The Humming One has been freeing lots of shadows!

333
00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.050
Before I knew it, there were countless victims!

334
00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:08.870
At this rate, the nightmare from five years ago will be repeated!

335
00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:14.850
Damn... He's the only man who could tell the zombies' weakn-

336
00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.020
Huh?

337
00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.630
How did he find out-

338
00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.000
Cindry-chan, why're you standing in front of me?!

339
00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:25.760
I've heard about him but... what is he like?

340
00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:30.730
Perona, you don't know what he looks like?

341
00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:34.180
Then, that's why he wasn't spotted.

342
00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:35.520
Master!

343
00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.660
That troublemaker has come once again...

344
00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:41.120
Like I care about such a thing, idiot!

345
00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:43.650
You take care of it!

346
00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:43.650
H-Hold on!

347
00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.700
Now, on to the freezer.

348
00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.280
Still, the current situation is...

349
00:21:57.220 --> 00:22:00.030
Idiot! Say that in the first place!

350
00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:02.520
In that case, we should be able to contain him.

351
00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.170
Yes.

352
00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.200
If there's a problem when he wakes up, report it.

353
00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.880
Now go ahead and throw Straw Hat out already.

354
00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:08.970
Yes!

355
00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.780
Heave-ho!

356
00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.020
Idiot, don't go out!

357
00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.440
It seems being stripped of your shadow won't kill you!

358
00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:19.310
It didn't kill Brook.

359
00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:21.360
We can't go out yet.

360
00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.320
We'll wait for our chance!

361
00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.690
It seems like they're going to do something with Luffy's shadow.

362
00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:29.490
We need to see what happens to it so we can get it back later!

363
00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.200
Those two are no longer here.

364
00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.530
Where did they go?

365
00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:37.360
I can't believe they got Tararan.

366
00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:38.900
Where's the enemy?!

367
00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:40.540
I'll cut them in an instant!

368
00:22:45.490 --> 00:22:47.210
Franky.

369
00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:50.550
What do you want?! I'm not crying!

370
00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:54.060
Idiot, don't look this way!

371
00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:57.520
Why did you ask him... such a question?

372
00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:00.910
Shut up! Don't mind me!

373
00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:06.440
Dammit! I love that skeleton now!

374
00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:08.740
There isn't a guy that good anywhere!

375
00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:10.580
Damn!

376
00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:14.010
You're right.

377
00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:26.250
As I thought, you're not gonna give up by merely kicking you out.

378
00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.630
Of course!

379
00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:31.050
Don't you know my name?

380
00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:34.450
Anyone who hears the name Swordmaster Ryuuma will cower in fear.

381
00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:35.440
Silence!

382
00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:36.720
You're my shadow!

383
00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.180
There's a big difference between our bodies.

384
00:23:40.460 --> 00:23:42.460
You shall return...

385
00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:44.520
To my feet!

386
00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:47.190
I can't wait!

387
00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:52.700
Back when I saw his corpse in the Ice Country, I couldn't help but tremble.

388
00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:59.480
It takes my breath away to think this repulsive thing rampaged through the seas 500 years ago!

389
00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:03.080
He took the entire island of each country he conquered to expand his own territory...

390
00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:01.770
Cold...!

391
00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:06.630
And thus he built the so called Evil Country.

392
00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:11.070
The very founder of the Country-Puller legend is right there!

393
00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:13.010
This will be the best zombie ever create-!

394
00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:16.780
The legend will be reborn once again!

395
00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:25.050
Now... it's time to resurrect...!

396
00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:27.440
The only man in history...!

397
00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:31.990
The wild warrior that was called the Demon!

398
00:24:33.910 --> 00:24:36.410
Oars!

399
